flowchart LR
  Shopper[Shopper] --> UI[Two-column JTV workspace]
  UI --> SDK[InstantSearch Chat SDK]
  SDK --> ChatAPI[Application /api/chat proxy]
  ChatAPI --> Agent[One Agent Studio Concierge]
  UI --> State[Per-tab shopping state]
  State --> Context[Bounded latest-turn context]
  Context --> Agent
  Agent -->|SDK tool call| Update[update_shopping_state callback]
  Update --> State
  Agent -->|SDK tool call| Retrieve[retrieve_evidence callback]
  Retrieve --> API[Read-only application API]
  API --> Product[(prod_catalog)]
  API --> Blog[(blog)]
  API --> Retrieve
  Retrieve --> Agent
  Agent -->|SDK tool call| Present[present_choices callback]
  Present --> Assess[Identity, constraint and subtotal checks]
  Assess -->|completed turn only| UI
  UI --> Refresh[Exact-ID refresh API]
  Refresh --> Product
  Refresh --> State
